<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans leading-relaxed antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col">

<!-- Chosen Palette: Warm Slate Neutral background (#f8fafc) with Emerald (#10b981), Slate (#334155), and Warm Amber (#f59e0b) Accents -->
<!-- Application Structure Plan: 
     - Top Navigation: Tabbed / Section anchor bar with live search & quick access to key decision areas.
     - Section 1: Executive Overview & Interactive LPR Optical Simulator (hands-on exploration of shutter speed, AGC, P-Iris, IR settings on various license plate types).
     - Section 2: Technical Standards & Physics Calculator (Pixel Density, Camera Angles, Latency vs Vehicle Speed Displacement physics formula).
     - Section 3: Target-Specific Enforcement Strategies (Tabbed view for Refl Film, Motorcycle Rear + Helmet, Construction Equipment + Virtual Loop).
     - Section 4: System Architecture & Edge/Security Framework (On-device NPU, TEE Masking, Merkle Tree Blockchain audit log visual flow).
     - Section 5: Commercial LPR Camera Matrix & Chart Analytics (Interactive comparison tool & Chart.js visualizations comparing 5 major camera models).
     - Section 6: Video Reference Hub & YouTube Demonstration Gallery (Categorized video references with search/filter).
     Rationale: Designed to transform heavy technical documentation into an intuitive decision-support tool for ITS project engineers and procurement officers.
-->
<!-- Visualization & Content Choices:
     1. LPR Optical Simulator -> Goal: Teach optical tuning concepts -> Interactive Canvas-based Camera Preview + Slider Control -> Real-time visual feedback on whiteout, blur, & OCR score.
     2. Speed-Latency Calculator -> Goal: Demonstrate physical displacement during trigger lag -> Dynamic Math Engine + Chart.js Line Chart -> Interactive speed slider (30-150km/h).
     3. Commercial Model Comparison -> Goal: Multi-attribute product evaluation -> Chart.js Horizontal Bar Chart + Interactive Dynamic Filter Table.
     4. Target Enforcement Workflows -> Goal: Explain domain-specific challenges -> Tabbed HTML/CSS Process Cards with Unicode indicators.
     5. Video Reference Hub -> Goal: Provide empirical verification -> Filterable Card Grid with YouTube links.
     Confirming NO SVG graphics used (Canvas and HTML/CSS web fonts only). NO Mermaid JS used.
-->
<!-- CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used. -->

    <!-- Header & Navigation -->
    <header class="bg-slate-900 text-white sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-slate-900 text-xl shadow">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-lg font-bold leading-tight">차세대 ITS LPR 카메라 기술 가이드</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-emerald-400">지능형 교통 시스템 다목적 차량 번호판 인식 통합 센터</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-1 text-sm font-medium">
                <button onclick="scrollToSection('simulator')" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-800 transition text-slate-200 hover:text-white">광학 시뮬레이터</button>
                <button onclick="scrollToSection('standards')" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-800 transition text-slate-200 hover:text-white">설치·하드웨어 기준</button>
                <button onclick="scrollToSection('targets')" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-800 transition text-slate-200 hover:text-white">대상별 단속 전략</button>
                <button onclick="scrollToSection('architecture')" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-800 transition text-slate-200 hover:text-white">엣지 AI & 보안</button>
                <button onclick="scrollToSection('matrix')" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-800 transition text-slate-200 hover:text-white">상용 카메라 비교</button>
                <button onclick="scrollToSection('videos')" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-800 transition text-slate-200 hover:text-white">시연 영상 레퍼런스</button>
            </nav>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-800">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle text-[8px] mr-1.5 text-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></i> ITS 2026 가이드라인
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 w-full space-y-12">

        <!-- Intro Hero Section -->
        <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl space-y-4">
                <div class="inline-block bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold">
                    LPR / ANPR PARADIGM SHIFT
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-snug">
                    단순 광학 식별을 넘어 <span class="text-emerald-400">능동형 능동 센서 노드</span>로의 진화
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    현대 LPR(License Plate Recognition) 카메라 시스템은 단순한 텍스트 추출을 넘어, 차량의 제조사·모델·색상·주행 궤적 등 복합 메타데이터를 실시간 추출하고 500ms 이내에 중앙 DB와 대조 연동하는 핵심 지능형 교통 인프라입니다. 반사필름, 이륜차 후면, 건설기계 등 가혹한 도로 환경을 극복하기 위한 최상의 기술적 조달 가이드를 제공합니다.
                </p>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pt-2">
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/80 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 text-center">
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">실시간 DB 조회</div>
                        <div class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400 font-mono">&lt; 500 ms</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/80 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 text-center">
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">권장 픽셀 폭</div>
                        <div class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400 font-mono">130 ~ 300 px</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/80 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 text-center">
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">설치 수직 각도</div>
                        <div class="text-lg font-bold text-sky-400 font-mono">&lt; 30° 이하</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/80 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 text-center">
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">고속 셔터 제어</div>
                        <div class="text-lg font-bold text-purple-400 font-mono">1/500 ~ 1/12,000s</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 1: INTERACTIVE LPR OPTICAL SIMULATOR -->
        <section id="simulator" class="space-y-4">
            <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. LPR 광학 및 조명 파라미터 실시간 인터랙티브 시뮬레이터</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
                    카메라의 셔터 속도, AGC(자동 게인 제어), P-Iris 조리개, IR 적외선 강도를 조절하여 다양한 번호판 환경(반사필름, 이륜차, 훼손)에서의 캡처 화질과 AI OCR 인식률 변화를 직접 실험해 보세요.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md border border-slate-200 p-5 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
                <!-- Controls Side (Left 5 Cols) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4 bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-emerald-600 mr-2"></i>광학 파라미터 설정</span>
                        <button onclick="resetSimulator()" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 underline">초기화</button>
                    </h4>

                    <!-- Target License Plate Type -->
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">감지 대상 번호판 유형</label>
                        <select id="simTargetType" onchange="updateSimulator()" class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:outline-none">
                            <option value="reflective">신형 반사필름식 번호판 (IR 난반사 야간 특성)</option>
                            <option value="motorcycle">이륜차(오토바이) 소형 후면 번호판</option>
                            <option value="damaged">건설기계 / 흙먼지 훼손 번호판</option>
                            <option value="standard">표준 페인트식 가로 긴 번호판</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Shutter Speed Slider -->
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">
                            <span>셔터 속도 (Shutter Speed)</span>
                            <span id="valShutter" class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">1/500 초</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="sliderShutter" min="1" max="5" step="1" value="3" oninput="updateSimulator()" class="w-full accent-emerald-600">
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
                            <span>1/30s (블러 심함)</span>
                            <span>1/500s (권장)</span>
                            <span>1/10000s (고속)</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- AGC Limit Slider -->
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">
                            <span>AGC 게인 레벨 (Auto Gain Control)</span>
                            <span id="valAGC" class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">Low (-30dB Limit)</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="sliderAGC" min="1" max="3" step="1" value="1" oninput="updateSimulator()" class="w-full accent-emerald-600">
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
                            <span>Low (포화 방지)</span>
                            <span>Medium</span>
                            <span>High (노이즈/포화)</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- P-Iris Aperture Control -->
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">
                            <span>P-Iris 조리개 수동 고정 (F-Number)</span>
                            <span id="valIris" class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">F/2.8 (수동 최적)</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="sliderIris" min="1" max="3" step="1" value="2" oninput="updateSimulator()" class="w-full accent-emerald-600">
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
                            <span>F/1.4 (완전개방)</span>
                            <span>F/2.8 (고정)</span>
                            <span>F/8.0 (자동-야간)</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- IR Illuminator Power -->
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">
                            <span>IR 적외선 투광기 파워 (850nm)</span>
                            <span id="valIR" class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">적정 (Medium)</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="sliderIR" min="1" max="3" step="1" value="2" oninput="updateSimulator()" class="w-full accent-emerald-600">
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
                            <span>OFF / Low</span>
                            <span>Medium</span>
                            <span>Max (과다 반사)</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Simulation Output Display (Right 7 Cols) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-eye text-sky-600 mr-1.5"></i>카메라 센서 실시간 캡처 뷰 (Simulated Frame)
                            </span>
                            <span id="simStatusBadge" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-300">
                                최적 화질 (인식 성공)
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Simulated Canvas Frame -->
                        <div class="relative w-full h-56 bg-slate-900 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-2 border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner">
                            <canvas id="simCanvas" class="w-full h-full block"></canvas>
                            <!-- Live Target ROI Overlay -->
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center">
                                <div class="w-64 h-20 border-2 border-dashed border-emerald-400 rounded flex items-center justify-center">
                                    <span class="text-[10px] bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">LPR OCR Target Zone</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Metrics & Diagnostics Dashboard -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-center">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">예상 OCR 인식률</div>
                            <div id="simScore" class="text-xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600 font-mono">99.2 %</div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">화이트아웃 (포화도)</div>
                            <div id="simWhiteout" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 mt-1">정상 (낮음)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">모션 블러 (잔상)</div>
                            <div id="simBlur" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 mt-1">없음 (&lt; 0.1px)</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Technical Guidance Box -->
                    <div id="simAdviceBox" class="p-3 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-lg text-xs text-emerald-900 leading-relaxed">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-600 mr-1"></i> <strong>광학 튜닝 조언:</strong> 현재 파라미터 조합은 고속 주행 시에도 야간 난반사나 모션 블러 없이 99% 이상의 높은 LPR 인식 정확도를 보장합니다.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 2: HARDWARE & OPTICS STANDARDS + SPEED LATENCY PHYSICS CALCULATOR -->
        <section id="standards" class="space-y-6">
            <div class="border-l-4 border-sky-500 pl-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. 하드웨어 표준 설치 기준 및 반응 지연 물리 계산기</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
                    규격별 번호판 픽셀 밀도, 설치 각도 기준 및 차량 주행 속도별 카메라 트리거 지연시간(Trigger Latency)에 따른 이동 거리 계산식을 분석합니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Standard Specifications Cards Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-sky-700 font-bold text-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-ruler-horizontal text-lg"></i>
                        <span>픽셀 밀도 (Pixel Density)</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                        <li class="flex justify-between border-b pb-1">
                            <span>한국 신형 / EU형 긴 번호판:</span>
                            <strong class="text-slate-800 font-mono">130 ~ 300 px</strong>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between border-b pb-1">
                            <span>미국형 기본 번호판:</span>
                            <strong class="text-slate-800 font-mono">80 ~ 300 px</strong>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between border-b pb-1">
                            <span>스택 기호 포함 번호판:</span>
                            <strong class="text-slate-800 font-mono">160 ~ 300 px</strong>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded">
                        ※ 권장 픽셀 범위를 초과하거나 미달할 경우 OCR 알고리즘의 폰트 분리 정확도가 저하되므로 전동 가변 초점 렌즈로 줌을 조절해야 합니다.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-sky-700 font-bold text-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-compass text-lg"></i>
                        <span>기하학적 설치 각도</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                        <li class="flex justify-between border-b pb-1">
                            <span>수직 내려다보기 각도 (Vertical):</span>
                            <strong class="text-amber-600 font-mono">&lt; 30° 미만</strong>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between border-b pb-1">
                            <span>카메라 렌즈 기울기 (Tilt):</span>
                            <strong class="text-amber-600 font-mono">&lt; 5° 미만</strong>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between border-b pb-1">
                            <span>이륜차 관측 좌우 각도:</span>
                            <strong class="text-amber-600 font-mono">&lt; 30° 이내</strong>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded">
                        ※ 설치 각도가 30°를 초과하면 원근 왜곡이 발생하여 '8'과 'B', '0'과 'O' 등 유사 문자의 오인식이 급증합니다.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-sky-700 font-bold text-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-[#fa-lightbulb] fa-lightbulb text-lg"></i>
                        <span>조명 & AGC 노출 제어</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                        <li class="flex justify-between border-b pb-1">
                            <span>IR 적외선 투광 파장:</span>
                            <strong class="text-slate-800 font-mono">850 nm (18~30m)</strong>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex justify-between border-b pb-1">
                            <span>역광 보정 (Backlight):</span>
                            <strong class="text-red-600 font-mono">원칙적 OFF</strong>
                        </li>
